trialuniformly samples two distinct rows 𝑟𝑎,𝑟𝑏from𝑇without
replacement, uniformly samples a non-empty subset 𝐶′⊆𝐶 Ψ,
swaps the values of 𝐶′between𝑟𝑎and𝑟𝑏to produce perturbed
