4 OPTIMIZATION STRATEGIES
The reliability verification stage ofAuto-Relatecan be computa-
tionally expensive. As analyzed in Sections 3.4 and 3.5, the Inde-
pendence Test runs in 𝑂(|𝑇|·|𝐶|) time per candidate, which is
linear in the table size and inexpensive in practice. The Perturba-
