per-candidate complexity of 𝑂(|𝑇|2·2|𝐶Ψ|), which is prohibitive
even for moderately sized tables.
To address these bottlenecks, we develop three complementary
optimization strategies for thePerturbationTest. We first introduce
agroup-by boundthat rejects candidate FRs before sampling begins
(Section 4.1). We then propose aclosed-form speed-upstrategy for
