Configuration.All experiments were conducted on a server run-
ning Ubuntu 20.04 with an Intel(R) Xeon(R) Platinum 8370C CPU
(2.80 GHz), 96 GB RAM, and a 1.8 TB SSD. ForAuto-Relate, we set
the perturbation threshold to 𝜂=0.5, the significance threshold in
the Independence Test to 𝛼=0.05, the maximum discovery level
ℓmax=4, and the accuracy threshold to 𝜏=1.0in the clean-data
setting and𝜏=0.8in the dirty-data setting. To exploit the within-
level independence of candidates, we set the degree of parallelism
to the number of CPU cores. All baselines were run with the default
configurations reported in their original papers.
